# Oven Roasted Asparagus

Based on [https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/…](https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/214931/oven-roasted-asparagus) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20250614211213/https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/214931/oven-roasted-asparagus))

{ rating="5" image="oven_roasted_asparagus.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 bunch [Asparagus]{ ing="asparagus" }
- [ ] 3 Tbsp [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
- [ ] 1.5 Tbsp [grated Parmesan cheese]{ ing="grated-parmesan-cheese" }
- [ ] 1 clove [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, minced
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [salt]{ ing="salt" }
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [ground black pepper]{ ing="ground-black-pepper" }
- [ ] 1 Tbsp [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" }

## Recipe

1. Preheat an oven to 425
1. Place the [asparagus]{ ing="asparagus" } into a mixing bowl and drizzle with the [olive oil]{ ing="olive-oil" }
1. Toss to coat, then sprinkle with Parmesan, [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, [salt]{ ing="salt" }, and [pepper]{ ing="ground-black-pepper" }
1. Arrange the asparagus onto a baking sheet in a single layer and bake for 12-15 min depending on thickness
1. Sprinkle with [lemon juice]{ ing="lemon-juice" } before serving
